# Fix Naming Logic and Configuration Access

The purpose of this change is to ensure that files processed by PCP Nexus are named correctly according to the project specifications. Currently, Phase 1 documents (Affidavits) are being incorrectly named using Phase 2 logic (AX40 + Envelope ID) because the application cannot find the renaming rules in the configuration file.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change modifies how output files are named. Phase 1 documents will now correctly use the `AX42`, `AX43`, `AX47`, or `AX89` prefixes followed by the PCP Job Number, rather than `AX40` followed by the Envelope ID.

